    kind: work_item  # ede7
    title: "go: an explicit generic instantiation call (Map[int](x), pkg.Map[int](x)) emits no calls edge at all -- the call site vanishes"  # ede7
    status: todo_hard  # ede7
    priority: 3  # ede7
    parent:  # ede7
    tags:  # ede7
    - go  # ede7
